config DRM_ACCEL_CALCULET
	tristate "Calculet KS1 PCIe accelerator"
	depends on DRM_ACCEL
	depends on PCI && PCI_MSI && HAS_IOMEM
	select CRC32
	help
	  DRM accel driver for CALCULET KS1 PCIe accelerators.

	  The driver exposes every board as /dev/accel/accelN, a per-board
	  sysfs attribute group and /proc/calculet_monitor. It provides BAR
	  register access, bidirectional DMA channels, MSI-X completion,
	  polled completion, process accounting, power management and PCIe
	  soft reset.

	  The userspace interface is described in
	  include/uapi/drm/calculet_accel.h.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called calculet_pci.
